[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2804970995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2804970995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2804970995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nMHXz","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T12:58:54Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T12:58:54Z","body":"New default renderer for macOS and iOS is Metal, which require iOS 16. We build with iOS 12 as min. target, so might still work with Vulkan and OpenGL, but it's not tested.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2804970995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2804988251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2804988251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2804988251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nMLlb","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T13:03:54Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T13:03:54Z","body":"Also, iPad Mini 2 is using A7 SoC, min. supported for Forward+/Moblie is A11 (Metal) or A12 (Vulkan). But it might still work with Compatibility (OpenGL).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2804988251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805052942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2805052942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2805052942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nMbYO","user":{"login":"maran","id":20855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran","html_url":"https://github.com/maran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T13:25:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T13:32:55Z","body":"> Also, iPad Mini 2 is using A7 SoC, min. supported for Forward+/Moblie is A11 (Metal) or A12 (Vulkan). But it might still work with Compatibility (OpenGL).\n\nSorry forgot to mention this is all on Compatibility (OpenGL). \n\nThis is what I get from the Xcode debugger, not telling me anything but hopefully this is useful for someone smarter then me.\n\n```\ndyld`__abort_with_payload:\n    0x1052fa410 <+0>:  mov    x16, #0x209               ; =521 \n    0x1052fa414 <+4>:  svc    #0x80\n->  0x1052fa418 <+8>:  b.lo   0x1052fa430               ; <+32>\n    0x1052fa41c <+12>: stp    x29, x30, [sp, #-0x10]!\n    0x1052fa420 <+16>: mov    x29, sp\n    0x1052fa424 <+20>: bl     0x1052f9850               ; cerror_nocancel\n    0x1052fa428 <+24>: mov    sp, x29\n    0x1052fa42c <+28>: ldp    x29, x30, [sp], #0x10\n    0x1052fa430 <+32>: ret    \n ```\n\nAnd a warning/error:\n\n```\ndyld: Symbol not found: _OBJC_CLASS_$_MTLCaptureDescriptor\n  Referenced from: /var/containers/Bundle/Application/318EADAE-438D-4E9A-B0FF-D9C13D3BA5CB/Playgroup-4.0.1.app/Playgroup-4.0.1\n  Expected in: /System/Library/Frameworks/Metal.framework/Metal\n in /var/containers/Bundle/Application/318EADAE-438D-4E9A-B0FF-D9C13D3BA5CB/Playgroup-4.0.1.app/Playgroup-4.0.1\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805052942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805147491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2805147491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2805147491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nMydj","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T13:55:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T13:55:58Z","body":"> dyld: Symbol not found: _OBJC_CLASS_$_MTLCaptureDescriptor\n\nSeems like it's still trying to load Metal. It should be lazy loaded, but it is possible you need a custom export template build with Metal/Vulkan completely disabled to run on OS that old. See https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_ios.html for build instruction (add `metal=no vulkan=no` to build it with OpenGL only.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805147491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805402457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2805402457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2805402457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nNwtZ","user":{"login":"maran","id":20855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran","html_url":"https://github.com/maran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T14:23:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T14:23:40Z","body":"Thanks, I will attempt that and see if that fixes the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2805402457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817134716","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2817134716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2817134716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n6hB8","user":{"login":"octanejohn","id":156664637,"node_id":"U_kgDOCVaDPQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156664637?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn","html_url":"https://github.com/octanejohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/octanejohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T11:53:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T12:20:33Z","body":"xcode 16.x is ios 15+ and xcode 15.x is ios 12+,  it loses apple chip a8 or lower exept ipad mini 4 and apple tv gen 4\nsee https://developer.apple.com/support/xcode/","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817134716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2871799707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2871799707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2871799707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rLC-b","user":{"login":"maran","id":20855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran","html_url":"https://github.com/maran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T09:41:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T09:41:54Z","body":"In order to get support back for iOS 12, I got my Macbook 2017 out with Xcode 15.2. However when I try to run it on an iOS 12 device I get a vague \"Sending qLaunchSuccess packet failed. \" error and it won't run. \n\nThe Xcode warnings tell me that lobMoltenVK.a is built for a newer iOS version (13.0) but being linked to 12.0. Is it possible the default export of Godot 4.3 is somehow set to 13.0 and therefor it can't run on 12?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2871799707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2871834263","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105418#issuecomment-2871834263","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105418","id":2871834263,"node_id":"IC_kw